OpenMagicka fork of MojoShader (altered source, see native/README.md).

Metal (SDL_GPU): a vertex shader input that the draw's vertex declaration does not supply is read
as float4(0, 0, 0, 1), as D3D9 and GL do, instead of failing the pipeline. Applies after 0005.

diff --git a/mojoshader_sdlgpu.c b/mojoshader_sdlgpu.c
